Clipboard.shortcut (when present): our own signed Send / Get menu shortcut,
generated by ./gen and signed with scripts/sign-shortcut.sh (needs a Mac).

"Send to Computer.shortcut" and "Get from Computer.shortcut": two signed iOS
shortcuts that come unchanged from
https://github.com/Unayung/omarchy-iphone-clipboard (MIT, see LICENSE here).
The hub offers them until Clipboard.shortcut exists.

All of them send the clipboard to a URL and fetch it back. On import they ask
for that URL, which the hub's /join page hands out together with a token, so
nothing in the files is specific to one hub. Signing needs macOS, which is why
the Unayung files are vendored and ours is built through a script.
